  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Scions of discordia are not proficient with any form of armor or shield. The Truenaming DC of any recitation recited by a scion of discordia is increased by the armor check penalty of any armor and shield the scion is wearing. For example, a scion wearing a suit of armor with an armor check penalty of 4 and a shield with an armor check penalty of 1 would increase all truenaming DCs by +5. If a suit of armor or a shield has no armor check penalty, it increases the truenaming DC by +1 instead. Armor or shields that are weightless or animated to take care of themselves do not penalize the scion's ability to recite in any way.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/scion-of-discordia#toc2\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
